    {
      "content": "Okay, awesome. And let me go ahead and explain how our pricing works. We charge $105 per hour per mover after we do the virtual Walter I will be able to identify how many movers and how many trucks you will be needing. And with this hourly rate, everything is included like the fuel and truck taxes, insurance, all wrap pads and bans to protect your items when being moved and all the tools for this assembly and reassembly of your furniture and appliances. There's only two things outside of the hourly rate. First is the packing materials that we will be using for your packing on the first day usually packing and entire 2500 square footage home, we were able to use total of, of $550 worth of packing materials.",
